  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza PEA Emergency Transformers installation - EGEMAC contract</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Gaza PEA Emergency Transformers installation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till palestinska energimyndigheten f&#xf6;r transport och leverans av ers&#xe4;ttningstransformatorer efter israeliskt lftangrepp p&#xe5; kraftverket i Gaza d&#xe5; transformatorerna som tidigare finansierats av Sverige f&#xf6;rst&#xf6;rdes. Till&#xe4;ggsbeslut f&#xf6;r n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga reservdelar efter  israeliska angrepp 2008/2009</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Palestinian Energy Authority for transport and installation of replacement transformers after Israeli airstrike on Gaza power plant 2006 when the transformers originally financed by Sweden were destroyed. Additional financing of essential spareparts after Israeli military attacks 2008/2009</narrative>
  </description>
